WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.748
[Ambient electronic music] Stop trapping PDFs inside an iframe.

00:00:03.044 --> 00:00:05.283
Meet ParaPDF — built for React.

00:00:05.345 --> 00:00:08.787
Portal real React components right onto pages in PDF points.

00:00:09.021 --> 00:00:12.131
Zoom or rotate, and they stay locked, with zero lag.

00:00:12.365 --> 00:00:15.127
Sync fillable PDF forms directly with React state,

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:17.851
and drive split viewports from a single worker.

00:00:17.989 --> 00:00:19.896
React stays out of the frame loop.

00:00:20.077 --> 00:00:23.436
[Crisp page-flip sound] Flip through a thousand pages with 55% less canvas memory,

00:00:23.485 --> 00:00:24.932
and zero blank frames.

00:00:25.264 --> 00:00:27.638
Two components. Zero worker setup.

00:00:27.990 --> 00:00:29.949
Open source, and ready today.

00:00:30.217 --> 00:00:32.224
Try ParaPDF. [Warm harmonic chime fades]
